## Why This Is Asked
The prompt probes distributed ICA, privacy, and real-time constraints across heterogeneous devices.

## Key Concepts
- Decentralized online convolutive ICA, masked statistics, cross-device permutation alignment.
- Dropout resilience, privacy-preserving aggregation, on-device evaluation.
- Time-varying mixing, latency budgets, evaluation with ground-truth sources.

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode: local whitening + ICA + masked share
function localICA(X) {
  const W = whiten(X);
  const S = fastICA(W);
  return S;
}
```

